      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EYE CAN EAR AMOUR (10) settled close to the pace and kept finding to win for the second time in a row last start over 1720m at this track, getting there by 3 metres. Not drawn the best so may need a 10/10 drive. Has the talent to register the hat-trick. MY ULTIMATE BUDDHA (7) was successful last start by a head at this track over 1720m after an encouraging minor placing the start before. Should enjoy a nice smother from this draw and will be looking for a split at some stage. This looks a sterner test than last time but he is capable of making it two on end. DAVOLAS LEGACY NZ (9) comes right into contention after scoring last start by 1.1 metres at this track over 1720m. NOTHINGBUTWAVES (1) should not have any excuses from the favourable draw.",
